    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Of the top 10 countries in the world with people suffering from diabetes, Pakistan ranks seventh, and by the year 2030, it will rank fourth - unless action is taken to implement effective public health programmes, said experts on World Diabetes Day at Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH).",
